          "message": "GUI SimpleStylized v5.1 - 1.20+\n\nHappy New Year to all!\n\n⚡New Mod Support for:\n- Added support for “Alex's Mobs” (Via Mod's Suggestion Form)\n- Added support for “Resource Backpack's” (Via Mod's Suggestion Form)\n- Added support for “Lightweight Inventory Sorting” (Via Mod's Suggestion Form)\n- Added support for “Oritech” (Via Mod's Suggestion Form)\n- Added support for “Grappling Hook Mod: Restitched” (Via Mod's Suggestion Form)\n- Added support for “Camera Utils”\n\n📋Improvements:\n- Supports version 46 (1.21.4)\n- Updated textures for “Curios API”\n- Updated textures for “OpenItemPuller\n- Updated textures for “EMI\n- Updated textures for “Traveler's Backpack” (1.21+)\n\n146 Mods compatible in total!",
