        "body": "Bumps [@sa11y/jest](https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest) from 5.3.0 to 7.0.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/releases\"><code>@​sa11y/jest</code>'s releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v7.0.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/compare/v6.13.0...v7.0.0\">7.0.0</a> (2025-01-01)</h2>\n<h3>⚠ BREAKING CHANGES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>drop nodejs 16 (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/776\">#776</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Miscellaneous Chores</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>drop nodejs 16 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/salesforce/sa11y/issues/776\">#776</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/5e1b6a2052bff00d6ebf20b2248e99e01e152f0e\">5e1b6a2</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v6.13.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/compare/v6.12.3...v6.13.0\">6.13.0</a> (2024-11-08)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>added new custom rule sa11y-Keyboard-button (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/salesforce/sa11y/issues/760\">#760</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/10067c9605c648abc1987a4e5a066eff7b16e05e\">10067c9</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v6.13.0-alpha.1</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/compare/v6.12.1...v6.13.0-alpha.1\">6.13.0-alpha.1</a> (2024-10-31)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>throw axe Error in case of axe not running (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/salesforce/sa11y/issues/753\">#753</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/beaa0090ef40535d41fdd5f5b4fa4225a8b02299\">beaa009</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v6.12.3</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/compare/v6.12.2...v6.12.3\">6.12.3</a> (2024-11-07)</h2>\n<h2>v6.12.1</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/compare/v6.12.0...v6.12.1\">6.12.1</a> (2024-10-18)</h2>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fixed metadata of resize-reflow-textoverflow custom rule (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/salesforce/sa11y/issues/748\">#748</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/2da71dd987b8f13e0a07a14c205282c1e978feea\">2da71dd</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v6.12.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/compare/v6.11.0...v6.12.0\">6.12.0</a> (2024-10-04)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>axe-core update to v4.10.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/salesforce/sa11y/issues/743\">#743</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/94bc67b4c358064439d640062a2d54e9edb79490\">94bc67b</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v6.11.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/compare/v6.10.3...v6.11.0\">6.11.0</a> (2024-09-17)</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/5e1b6a2052bff00d6ebf20b2248e99e01e152f0e\"><code>5e1b6a2</code></a> chore!: drop nodejs 16 (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/776\">#776</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/292eea6e7218b86e2881195c278cd212bf84290e\"><code>292eea6</code></a> docs(README): Update README.md</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/08c9808b253c68fb3d97d7147075cb635f7eaadc\"><code>08c9808</code></a> docs: Update README.md</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/94bc67b4c358064439d640062a2d54e9edb79490\"><code>94bc67b</code></a> feat: axe-core update to v4.10.0 (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/743\">#743</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/2fe695a0b593b37e4f126e586348c1b5ce0bd624\"><code>2fe695a</code></a> feat: added functionality of incomplete resultType (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/730\">#730</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/1f5d3dc24b26e096686cc22436998661705b490a\"><code>1f5d3dc</code></a> feat: dom mutation observer changes (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/708\">#708</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/20778083b656180c2b077a4a7148cf813c05d040\"><code>2077808</code></a> fix: updated the stacktrace (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/706\">#706</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/6cd04b2964c35d10b0b38797e43390ed21dbbb85\"><code>6cd04b2</code></a> fix: axe-core dependency in preset-rule (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/689\">#689</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/2eca6d223e98bd7794c7283bd87d7c1d57d407cb\"><code>2eca6d2</code></a> fix: added processor for manual checks (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/686\">#686</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commit/a953b9b6e8a49bb8d1af366e71cd82d573ad7b03\"><code>a953b9b</code></a> fix: fix custom rules for selenium (<a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/tree/HEAD/packages/jest/issues/688\">#688</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/sa11y/commits/v7.0.0/packages/jest\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility score](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=@sa11y/jest&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=5.3.0&new-version=7.0.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\